Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.48,0:00:05.74,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s like they just can’t sleep lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.74,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,No physical issues present.{体に 異常なし｡}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.08,0:00:18.75,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,To get good sleep, \N you need a healthy level of exercise...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.75,0:00:23.25,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Oh, and drinking some hot milk \N to relax before bed can help, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.21,0:00:32.89,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two! \N One, two! One, two!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.89,0:00:34.47,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Healthy level of exercise!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.15,0:00:45.69,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Hot milk to relax!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.99,0:00:50.66,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Now, let’s get to sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.11,0:00:52.53,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Good night!{Pokemon: oya~ (Night.)}
Comment: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:10.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:40.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.13,0:03:12.51,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wanival and Dekanuchan \N couldn’t sleep again today?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.51,0:03:13.34,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.34,0:03:14.63,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,What about Surfugo?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.63,0:03:15.97,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Out like a light.{超爆睡｡}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.76,0:03:23.14,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,They all do the same things, eat the same stuff, \N and sleep in the same place,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.14,0:03:25.10,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,so why can’t they seem to sleep...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.10,0:03:29.90,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,That is intriguing.{ENgame: interesting} Pokémon that are unable to sleep, \N in the same conditions as those that can.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.40,0:03:32.32,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Wanival and Dekanuchan...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.32,0:03:36.20,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,They’re not nocturnal Pokémon, \N yet they’re unable to sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.20,0:03:38.49,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,There has to be some reason behind it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.49,0:03:39.57,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Who’re you, old dude?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ult, don’t be rude!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.03,0:03:44.16,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Whoops. I hadn’t introduced myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.16,0:03:48.42,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,My name’s Neroli. \N I study Pokémon sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.42,0:03:50.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Study sleep?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.63,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Don’t tell me...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.17,0:03:57.80,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,You’re the Professor Neroli \N who studies Pokémon sleep ecology?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.80,0:03:58.51,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.51,0:04:01.14,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Pokémon sleep economy?{Ult getting tripped up over the ology}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.14,0:04:05.02,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Many Pokémon feel better \N after some good sleep,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.02,0:04:07.85,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,and wake up prepared{able} \N to fully exert themselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.85,0:04:10.27,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Sleeping is very important!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.81,0:04:13.52,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Feeling better after \N some good sleep...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.49,0:04:20.49,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Whoops. I’ll miss my ship \N if I dilly-dally too much.{nonbiri}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.49,0:04:22.99,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.99,0:04:25.87,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,I do fieldwork on Wakakusa Isle.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.87,0:04:28.25,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Professor Neroli!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.75,0:04:31.71,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Could you see \N my Wanival and Dekanuchan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.71,0:04:34.21,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,We can take you to Wakakusa Isle!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.21,0:04:34.88,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.85,0:04:45.60,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Next stop, Wakakusa Isle!{Now, to young-grass main island!}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.27,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.98,0:04:52.31,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,All done with what?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.31,0:04:53.98,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,This is my room.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.98,0:04:56.19,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I put in surveillance cameras.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.19,0:04:59.99,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I told Wanival and Dekanuchan \N to take a nap,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.99,0:05:01.99,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,but it looks like \N they still can’t sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.95,0:05:05.62,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,What are they like by nature?{What are their Natures?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.99,0:05:09.62,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival is a kind and cheerful \N little guy who loves to dance.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.00,0:05:12.88,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,He’s serious{nature}, \N with a little bit of a sensitive side.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.58,0:05:18.26,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Dekanuchan is daring and intense{豪快}, \N but she also has an artisan’s mindset{has a craftsman's disposition},{no game natures}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.63,0:05:22.05,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,and when she sets her mind on something, \N she tends to lose track of all else...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.68,0:05:27.60,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Perhaps... \N They could be afraid of something.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.60,0:05:28.35,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.35,0:05:33.85,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Take a look. Dekanuchan is putting \N quite a bit of force into her grip on her hammer.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.90,0:05:37.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’re right!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.65,0:05:42.66,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,{\q2}Maybe their defensive instincts are kicking in, \N to try and protect them from something.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.36,0:05:47.41,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Has anything been scaring them lately?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.41,0:05:48.70,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Scaring...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.58,0:05:52.16,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Oh! “Here’s Ghosty From the Gaps”!{o-konbanwa ("Good evening") is the JP dub translation of the famous line "Here's Johnny" from the Shining, replacing a US night-time TV show greeting with a Japanese night-time greeting. But keeping it as "Good evening" would obscure the reference.}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.16,0:05:53.42,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,“Here’s Ghosty”...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.42,0:05:54.42,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,The heck’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.88,0:05:58.63,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,A type of ghost story stream \N that’s taken off lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.21,0:06:03.43,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Though it’s all just \N Ghost-type Pokémon popping out of gaps.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.39,Main,Ghost man,0,0,0,,Everyone, thanks for tuning in.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.39,0:06:10.60,Main,Ghost man,0,0,0,,Tonight, I wonder... \N Which gap will the “Here’s Ghosty” come from?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.44,Main,Ghost man,0,0,0,,Well, let’s get straight to it...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.44,0:06:14.69,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Isn’t that gap by the cabinet \N kinda sketchy?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.69,0:06:20.44,Main,Ghost man,0,0,0,,Woo... Where’s it gonna come from? \N Ooh, so scary, so scary...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.07,Main,Ghost man,0,0,0,,Ahh! Ah! Here’s Ghosty!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.45,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.45,0:06:33.04,Main,Ghost man,0,0,0,,Come on, I hear you, I hear you, I hear you... \N What is it, what is that sound? So scary, scary...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.21,Main,Ghost man,0,0,0,,Ahh! Here’s Ghosty!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.21,0:06:37.96,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,No way! A Jupetta was back there?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.26,0:06:44.38,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I found it fun, \N to me it was like a video game.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.38,0:06:48.72,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,But... Maybe it really scared \N Wanival and Dekanuchan...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.10,0:06:52.52,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So {\i1}I’m{\i0} the one who \N stopped you from sleeping...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.98,0:06:55.69,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Sorry, Wanival, Dekanuchan...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.31,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Dot...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.86,0:06:58.94,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,I’ve an idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.36,0:07:02.57,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Why don’t you all come join me \N on my fieldwork?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.57,0:07:03.53,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.53,0:07:06.36,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,The Kabigon at my destination \N of Wakakusa Isle...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.36,0:07:12.04,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,{\q2}...produce a mysterious energy called “Drowsy Power” \N that makes Pokémon drift off to sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.50,0:07:15.83,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,It’s bound to put Wanival \N and Dekanuchan to sleep as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.42,0:07:24.26,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Amazing! Look! \N What Pokémon is that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.68,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh! And more over there! \N Look, look!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.68,0:07:28.30,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wow! And even here, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.68,0:07:28.30,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\an8}Shut it, Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.89,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Those are Purin.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.31,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,And that’s a Mankey.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.31,0:07:36.56,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It feels like the Pokémon here \N are all super relaxed.{nonbiri}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.52,0:07:41.77,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Even Wanival and Dekanuchan \N should be able to sleep here, yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.78,0:07:48.74,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,They’re all riled up \N because they’re in a new place...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.24,0:07:51.91,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Professor Neroli?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.91,0:07:52.95,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.91,0:08:00.50,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh, a Kabigon! It’s mega-huge!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.50,0:08:01.67,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.67,0:08:03.50,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Quiet, Ult!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.93,0:08:18.64,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh, Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.64,0:08:24.94,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. \N Kabigon’s belly is a safe place for Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.94,0:08:25.90,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.82,0:08:28.53,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m so jealous...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.37,0:08:37.16,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,They’re all relaxing...!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.16,0:08:40.29,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It’s even making me feel mellower.{mattari}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.14,0:08:54.81,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,They’re getting sleepy?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.36,0:09:07.94,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Aww, they looked {\i1}so{\i0} close \N to falling asleep!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.94,0:09:09.99,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I wonder why Kabigon got up.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.07,0:09:14.99,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,It looks like it’s hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.99,0:09:19.66,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Kabigon love to sleep, \N but they also really love to eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.66,0:09:23.75,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,I have an idea! \N How about we make this?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.25,0:09:26.55,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,“Hyper Sleep Butter Curry”?{ENgame: "Dream Eater" Butter Curry}{TPCi why...}{TPCi: zettai nemuri? comatose! zettai nemuri butter curry? dream eater butter curry!}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.55,0:09:28.51,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,A Kabigon favorite!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.96,0:09:32.01,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,When they stuff their face \N and belly with this,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.01,0:09:33.97,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,they drift straight off.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.97,0:09:36.64,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Even the name’s \N got me feeling sleepy!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.64,0:09:40.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,We’re really good at making curry!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.02,0:09:42.65,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yeah! You can leave it to us!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.65,0:09:46.90,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Roy, your curries are crazy spicy! \N You’ll just wake it up!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.90,0:09:50.95,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. \N The Hyper Sleep Butter Curry isn’t spicy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.95,0:09:53.70,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yay! I love curry!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.28,0:09:55.45,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s all make it together!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.20,0:10:02.16,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Kabigon eat a staggering amount, \N so it’ll be quite a taxing job...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.37,0:10:06.59,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Then, to make sure \N Wanival and Dekanuchan nod off...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.59,0:10:09.96,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I’ll make it a huge helping \N of Hyper Sleep Butter Curry!
Comment: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.94,0:10:33.03,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,The Hyper Sleep Butter Curry’s \N ingredients are...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.03,0:10:35.11,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Calming Potatoes...{ENgame: Soft Potato}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.11,0:10:37.07,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Relax Cocoa...{ENgame: Soothing Cacao}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.49,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Restful Tomatoes...{ENgame: Snoozy Tomato}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.08,0:10:40.54,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,...and Moomoo Milk.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.95,0:10:43.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Where do we get those?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.37,0:10:45.42,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,And we need loads of ‘em, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.42,0:10:49.67,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,You can have these guys help you; \N they know this isle well!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.67,0:10:53.76,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.18,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.93,0:10:59.68,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Let’s split up \N and gather the ingredients!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.81,0:11:08.23,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya, \N let’s give it our best shot!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.82,0:11:16.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow! These are Calming Potatoes?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.70,0:11:25.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ready, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.34,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,We picked ‘em!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.07,0:12:00.07,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Ooh, that’s a big one!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.07,0:12:00.57,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.54,0:12:04.50,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.83,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,You rest here.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.29,0:12:11.46,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,You’re exhausted \N from lack of sleep, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.25,0:12:15.13,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on the fruits \N I picked with Dekanuchan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.36,0:13:22.74,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival! Dekanuchan! \N Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.03,0:13:25.99,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Whoa! A Jupetta and a Ghost?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.46,0:13:31.50,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Phew, so it was just \N Restful Tomatoes...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.50,0:13:34.50,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Either way, \N that’s a heck of an appetite{ they’ve got}.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.17,0:13:39.21,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s okay, Wanival, Dekanuchan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.21,0:13:45.01,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Jupetta and Ghost are just hungry, \N and they’re not scaring anyone, so you can relax.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.64,0:13:52.06,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Cap! It’s okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.73,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Give those to Jupetta and Ghost.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.95,0:14:05.07,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Everyone’s waiting, so let’s go.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.58,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We managed to get \N all the ingredients!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.58,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Ooh! You sure gathered a lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.58,0:14:18.55,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Everyone, thanks for helping us out!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.21,0:14:23.22,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I’m seriously starvin’!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.72,0:14:30.97,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,{\q2}All right, time to make a Rising Voltteccers-style \N Hyper Sleep Butter Curry!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.97,0:14:33.44,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.53,0:14:49.41,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.51,0:15:03.55,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.80,0:15:06.26,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.85,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,You’re giving them back?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.89,0:15:18.65,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Maybe... they want to \N get in on making it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.27,0:15:20.27,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.53,0:15:30.78,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let’s have Jupetta \N and Ghost help, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.97,0:15:51.39,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That just leaves Relax Cocoa \N for the secret flavor.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.02,0:15:57.69,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, Jupetta!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.69,0:15:58.52,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,O-Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.52,0:16:02.40,Main,Ult Navi,0,0,0,,Smells great!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.90,0:16:07.49,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.49,0:16:09.16,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’re those?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.16,0:16:12.66,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,You can use these fans \N to adjust the heat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.02,0:16:41.40,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hilarious!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.65,0:16:44.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi wanna try!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.25,0:17:00.71,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Seems like Wanival and Dekanuchan \N are all right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.96,0:17:04.92,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Gotta be almost ready, don’t it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.92,0:17:08.63,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh! We still need to add \N the most important ingredient!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.63,0:17:09.84,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Right, Dot?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.84,0:17:10.63,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.63,0:17:14.26,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Come on, what’s the most important \N part of making a curry?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.26,0:17:14.93,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.93,0:17:17.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What, what is it? Tell Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.22,0:17:19.39,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What every curry needs!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.39,0:17:20.69,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Which is...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.23,0:17:22.73,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,...your {\i1}heart!{\i0}
Comment: 10,0:17:22.73,0:17:24.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wah! Ahahaha!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.48,0:17:25.11,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.28,0:17:28.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Like this? Heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.32,0:17:29.32,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.49,0:17:35.33,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Is this it? Heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.33,0:17:37.24,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Okay! Now you, Ult!
Comment: 10,0:17:35.74,0:17:36.62,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\an8}Urk!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.24,0:17:40.46,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Like I’d ever do {\i1}that!{\i} Right, Dot?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.08,0:17:42.21,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Let’s do it together.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.21,0:17:43.08,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.50,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I know {\i1}painfully{\i0} well \N where you’re coming from... {TL: I know how you feel, almost too much. / I understand Ult's feelings to the point it hurts.}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.50,0:17:48.30,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,But {\i1}heart{\i0} is an essential part of curry!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.30,0:17:49.21,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.21,0:17:50.17,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.17,0:17:53.39,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. Heart isn’t scary!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.39,0:17:55.89,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,We need your heart, Ult!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.89,0:17:56.68,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.56,0:18:00.06,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Ready, and...!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.06,0:18:02.94,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Rargh... Whatever!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.94,0:18:04.81,Main,Dot Ult,0,0,0,,Heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.45,0:18:20.66,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Kabigon. \N This is Hyper Sleep Butter Curry. Dig in!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.26,0:18:35.30,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Seems like it’s a hit.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.01,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.01,0:18:38.51,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We should have some, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.51,0:18:39.31,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.81,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time to dig in!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.81,0:18:47.94,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,The curry I made tastes great!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.86,0:18:52.44,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Good, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.83,0:19:03.75,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Meals always taste best \N with everyone gathered ‘round.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.75,0:19:04.50,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.39,0:19:24.56,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Doesn’t Kabigon look \N bigger than before?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.94,0:19:28.81,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Looks full and satisfied. \N Now it might have a good sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.65,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I’m stuffed and sweepy...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.65,0:19:35.57,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Been up and about \N since morning, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.39,0:20:03.10,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival... Dekanuchan... \N Good night.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.41,0:20:20.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Professor Neroli, \N what are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.53,0:20:21.53,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.53,0:20:23.45,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,This is sleep research.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.25,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Sleep research?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.25,0:20:27.66,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,That’s Purin’s Spacey Sleep.{ENgame}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.25,0:20:31.54,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,It looks like it’s spacing out, \N but it’s really just sleeping.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.54,0:20:33.04,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It looks like it’s awake!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.04,0:20:37.13,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,And that’s Wooper’s Grinning Sleep{ENgame: Smiling Sleep}, \N where it smiles in its sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.13,0:20:38.93,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That looks kinda fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.30,0:20:43.01,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,That’s Mankey’s Angry Sleep. \N It’s sleeping while angry.{ENgame}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.81,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I’m surprised it can sleep like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.81,0:20:48.73,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,That’s Usokki’s Fake Tree Sleep, \N where it acts like a tree while asleep.{ENgame: Pseudo-Wood Sleep}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.19,0:20:54.27,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh? Those two Togekiss \N are each sleeping in different ways!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.27,0:20:56.53,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,That’s Free-Flight Sleep.{ENgame}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.53,0:20:58.74,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,And that one’s Acrobatic-Flight Sleep.{ENgame}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.74,0:21:02.53,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,You can find various {lit: sleeping faces}sleeping styles, \N even among the same Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.33,0:21:05.24,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,There’s a Munna over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.66,0:21:08.46,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,That’s Dream Smoke Sleep.{ENgame: Dream Mist Sleep}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.46,0:21:13.17,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,When Munna eat fun dreams, \N they breathe out pink smoke.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.54,0:21:16.88,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,I guess everyone \N must be having fun dreams.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.38,0:21:18.63,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh, look!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.30,0:21:22.01,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ult’s doing a Synchronized-With-Yamirami Sleep!{not a game term}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.43,0:21:25.76,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi’s doing a Metamon-Hugging Sleep \N while it’s turned to stone!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.76,0:21:27.47,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Wh-What’s that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.47,0:21:30.69,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ah... Cap sleeps like that often.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.35,0:21:33.56,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,I-I’ve never seen anything like this!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.94,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,A Pikachu’s Tail-Stand Sleep!{ENgame}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.94,0:21:37.53,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shh!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.53,0:21:39.82,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,Incredible! \N Incredible, incredible, incredible!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.82,0:21:41.03,Main,Neroli,0,0,0,,It’s so incredible...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.03,0:21:44.70,Main,Neroli,0,300,0,,I’m gonna have \N good dreams tonight!
Comment: 10,0:21:45.53,0:21:45.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.79,0:21:48.41,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.41,0:21:51.92,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.04,0:21:55.29,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Kabigon!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.29,0:21:58.05,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Not much can wake \N a Kabigon once it falls asleep,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.05,0:22:01.55,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,but there’s an ace in the hole that can! \N Do you know what it is?{totteoki, a move}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.51,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:36.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.40,0:23:42.36,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.36,0:23:43.90,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.90,0:23:46.11,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,C: Play a Flute!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:46.11,0:23:50.41,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,A Pokémon Flute can apparently prompt{make} \N even a Kabigon to suddenly spring awake!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.03,0:23:53.04,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We can’t get through like this...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.04,0:23:54.54,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.54,0:23:55.91,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,A Pokémon Flute!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.91,0:23:57.33,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So, without further ado...{So, [right away/without further ado]... (plays flute)}
Comment: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.34,0:24:03.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, you heard of \N Pokémon Contests?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.96,0:24:05.63,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’s that? Some kinda battle?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.63,0:24:09.26,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,More like... a sparkling stage where you \N vie to dazzle with your Pokémon’s charms!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.26,0:24:10.93,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,They’re super cool...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.93,0:24:12.56,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,...and crazy cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.56,0:24:13.93,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Plus, they bring on the feels!{Plus, they're emo-y!}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.93,0:24:15.60,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whaddaya mean “feels”...?{"Emo-y" netslang for emotional with English 'emo'}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.60,0:24:19.06,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And we’re going to enter \N a Pokémon Contest for the first time!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.90,0:24:23.48,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.48,0:24:26.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Crazy Feels! This Is a Pokémon Contest, Dearie!!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.40,0:24:27.32,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,“Dearie”?!{What to do about zamasu. Middle-aged woman stereotype, don't know who will say it in the ep (if someone even does), but Navi apparently appoints herself as coach to compete against the Cutey Street Pikapikas, so it might really come out of Navi}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.32,0:24:29.32,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Tell me already, \N what’s this “feels” thing?!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
